 "notes": [
  "Fan Zhendong and Chen Meng, the two Olympic singles champions, withdrew from the world rankings on 27 December 2024 rather than pay WTT's fines for missing its events. Fan said he could not afford the fines and that he was not retiring. He has no ranking points, so he does not appear in the world rankings.",
  "He moved to Germany for the 2025-26 season with 1. FC Saarbrücken, who won the German Cup, the Champions League and the German title, and joined Borussia Düsseldorf in July 2026 on a one-year contract. He has won all eight of his Bundesliga singles for Düsseldorf this season. The club left him out of two team matches in November without giving a reason, and he returned on 15 November."
